# Warzone Mobile Offline – Godot Web Port

An experimental **Godot Engine** port of my offline *Warzone Mobile* project. Built using locally extracted game assets, this version is adapted to run directly in a modern web browser.

The goal of this project is to preserve and explore the game's maps, modes, and core gameplay in a standalone environment—completely independent of the original online servers. The current build focuses on local gameplay, offline bot support, and smooth browser compatibility.

---

## ✨ Features
* **Browser-Ready:** Playable directly in a modern web browser without installation.
* **Powered by Godot:** Rebuilt and adapted using the Godot Engine.
* **Original Assets:** Utilizes locally extracted assets from *Warzone Mobile*.
* **100% Offline:** Local gameplay with zero connection to official servers required.
* **Bot Support:** Includes functional offline bots for solo matches.

---

## 🎮 Controls & Keybinds

| Key | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| **`V`** | Toggle third-person view |
| **`K`** | Toggle flight mode |
| **`M`** | Open minimap |
| **`²`** | Open developer console |

---

## 🚧 Project Status
This project is **actively under development**. Because it is an experimental port:
* Some maps, textures, menus, shaders, audio, and gameplay systems may be incomplete or behave differently than the original mobile release.
* Overall performance and stability depend heavily on your web browser, operating system, and graphics hardware.

